  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "あいくるしい　みためだが　おこって\nジタバタする　てあしに　ぶつかると\nプロレスラーでも　ふっとばされる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "사랑스러운 외모지만 화가 나서\n버둥거리는 손발에 부딪히면\n프로레슬러라도 날아가 버린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "外表惹人喜愛，但如果被牠\n發怒後胡亂揮舞的腿碰到，\n即使是職業摔角手也會被踢到老遠。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il est à croquer, sauf lorsqu’il s’énerve et frappe\nà tout va. Dans ce cas, laissez-le tranquille ou\nvous finirez à coup sûr dans le décor.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es sieht sehr süß aus, aber wehe, es wird\nwütend. Mit seinen Armen wirbelnd haut es\nselbst den stärksten Wrestler um.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Pese a su aspecto encantador, cuando se enoja,\nsus pataletas son tan feroces que pueden\nderribar hasta a un luchador profesional.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Tenero all’apparenza, quando si arrabbia agita\nbraccia e gambe con una furia tale da atterrare\npersino un lottatore di wrestling.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Despite its adorable appearance, when it gets\nangry and flails about, its arms and legs could\nknock a pro wrestler sprawling.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "愛くるしい　見た目だが　怒って\nジタバタする　手足に　ぶつかると\nプロレスラーでも　吹っ飛ばされる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "外表惹人喜爱，但如果被\n发怒后胡乱挥舞的腿脚碰到，\n即便是职业摔角手也会被击飞。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Pese a su aspecto encantador, cuando se enoja,\nsus pataletas son tan feroces que pueden\nderribar hasta a un luchador profesional.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "なついた　あいてや　なかまいがいに\nさわられると　ものすごい　ちからで\nあばれるので　ひじょうに　キケン。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "친밀한 사이나 동료 이외의 사람이\n만지면 굉장한 힘으로\n날뛰기 때문에 매우 위험하다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "除了親密的對象和夥伴以外，\n一旦被接觸到，便會用可怕的\n力量發狂，所以很危險。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ne tentez pas de le caresser s’il ne vous connaît\npas assez : il entrerait dans une rage folle,\net vous encourriez un grand danger.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Wird es von irgendjemand anderem als seinen\nKameraden angefasst, flippt es aus und schlägt\nmit unglaublicher Kraft wild um sich.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando alguien con quien no haya congeniado lo\ntoca, se pone hecho una furia y despliega una\nfuerza tal que lo hace tremendamente peligroso.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È molto pericoloso perché attacca furiosamente\nchiunque lo tocchi, a meno che non sia un amico\no un suo simile.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "A touch from anyone except a known friend\nsends it into a surging frenzy. It’s an incredibly\ndangerous Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "なついた　相手や　仲間以外に\n触られると　物凄い　力で\n暴れるので　非常に　キケン。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "如果被亲密的对象和伙伴以外的\n接触到，就会用可怕的力量发狂，\n所以很危险。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando alguien con quien no haya congeniado lo\ntoca, se pone hecho una furia y despliega una\nfuerza tal que lo hace tremendamente peligroso.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "たいぼくも　へしおる　ちからじまん。\nおしりの　きかんから　においを　だし\nなかまと　コミュニケーションをとる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "큰 나무도 꺽을 만큼 힘이 세다.\n엉덩이의 기관에서 냄새를 풍겨\n동료와 커뮤니케이션을 한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "以連大樹都能折斷的力氣為傲。\n會從臀部的器官發出氣味，\n藉此與夥伴進行溝通。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il est si fort qu’il peut abattre un grand arbre.\nL’odeur que dégage l’organe sur son derrière lui\npermet de communiquer avec ses semblables.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es ist stark genug, um große Baumstämme zu\nzerbrechen. Über Düfte aus dem Organ am\nHinterteil kommuniziert es mit Artgenossen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es capaz de derribar un árbol con su fuerza. Se\ncomunica con sus congéneres mediante el olor\nque emite el órgano de su parte posterior.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Riesce a spezzare anche gli alberi più grossi.\nComunica con i suoi simili usando l’odore che\nemana da un organo che ha sul posteriore.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It boasts power enough to split large trees in\nhalf. The organ on its rear releases an odor that\nit uses to communicate with others of its kind.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "大木も　へし折る　力自慢。\nおしりの　器官から　匂いを　出し\n仲間と　コミュニケーションをとる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "以连大树都能折断的力量而自豪。\n从臀部的器官发出气味，\n与伙伴进行交流。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es capaz de derribar un árbol con su fuerza. Se\ncomunica con sus congéneres mediante el olor\nque emite el órgano de su parte posterior.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "だきしめられたり　さわられるのが\nだいきらい。　ジタバタ　あばれて\nていこうする　ちからは　ものすごい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "껴안거나 만지는 것을\n아주 싫어한다. 바둥바둥 날뛰면서\n저항하는 힘이 굉장하다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "非常討厭被抱住或是被觸摸。\n會手腳亂揮地掙扎，\n抵抗的力氣非常大。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il déteste être touché ou pris dans les bras,\net se débat de toutes ses forces pour\nse dégager.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es hasst es, angefasst oder gar gedrückt zu\nwerden und wehrt sich dagegen, indem es mit\nunglaublicher Kraft wild um sich schlägt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Odia que lo toquen o lo abracen. Se resiste\nempleando toda su fuerza, que es considerable.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Detesta profondamente essere toccato o\nabbracciato e resiste dibattendosi con tutta\nla sua incredibile forza.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Stufful hates to be hugged or touched in any\nway. It will squirm, thrash, and resist with\namazing power.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "抱きしめられたり　触られるのが\n大嫌い。　ジタバタ　暴れて\n抵抗する　力は　ものすごい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "非常讨厌被抱住或是被碰触。\n手脚乱蹬挣扎抵抗的力气会非常大。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Odia que lo toquen o lo abracen. Se resiste\nempleando toda su fuerza, que es considerable.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ふわふわの　けなみは　さわりごこちが\nばつぐんだが　うかつに　てを　だすと\nていたい　はんげきを　うけてしまう。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "푹신푹신한 털은 감촉이\n뛰어나지만 섣불리 손을 댔다간\n호되게 반격을 당하고 만다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
